  "disclaimer": "*This % may represent an aggregate of THC/CBD, THCa/CBDa, THCb/CBDb within the product. Consumers should review the actual product label for exact % of THC/CBD.",
  "description": "Harbor House presents Super Silver Haze x Albarino Badder, a premium 1g cannabis extract that combines two legendary genetics into one exceptional concentrate. This collaboration merges the uplifting, energetic qualities of Super Silver Haze with the unique aromatic profile of Albarino, creating a badder with a creamy, whipped texture that's perfect for dabbing. Expect a complex flavor profile featuring citrus, earthy, and herbal notes that dance across the palate with each session. The concentrate delivers focused, creative effects ideal for daytime use or social activities. Harbor House's expert extraction process preserves the full spectrum of cannabinoids and terpenes, ensuring maximum potency and flavor in every dab. This 1g badder offers cannabis connoisseurs a premium experience that showcases the craftsmanship and quality Harbor House is known for.",
